    157  11cc							; SMART CHORD / EXTENSIONS: each held note becomes a chord built in the key.
    158  11cc							; A note in the scale gets its diatonic chord (stacked scale thirds: triad,
    159  11cc							; or 7 / 9 / 11 / 13 with extensions). A note outside the scale gets a
    160  11cc							; major triad (+ b7, 9, 11, 13). Results merge, ascending, at most 8.
    161  11cc				   Expand
    162  11cc					      subroutine
    163  11cc		       ae 01 c3 	      ldx	heldCount
    164  11cf		       8e af c3 	      stx	exCount
